          "text": "<p>What is the output of the following code?</p><pre dir=\"ltr\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  int x; int x;  int main() {     printf(&quot;%d&quot;, x);     return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint x;\nint x;\n\nint main() {\n    printf(\"%d\", x);\n    return 0;\n}</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li>$\\texttt{0}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Garbage value<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Compilation error<br>&nbsp;</li><li>Linker error</li></ol>",
