          "post_id": "534931",
          "text": "<p data-start=\"3939\" data-end=\"4054\">Given the following three files, what will be the output after compiling and linking them together?</p><p data-start=\"4056\" data-end=\"4067\"><strong>file1.c</strong></p><pre data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4114\" data-rawcode=\"extern int i;  void f() {     i++; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">extern int i;\n\nvoid f() {\n    i++;\n}</pre><p data-start=\"4116\" data-end=\"4127\"><strong>file2.c</strong></p><pre data-start=\"4129\" data-end=\"4182\" data-rawcode=\"int i = 0;  void f();  void g() {     f(); }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"2\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">int i = 0;\n\nvoid f();\n\nvoid g() {\n    f();\n}</pre><p data-start=\"4184\" data-end=\"4194\"><strong>main.c</strong></p><pre data-start=\"4196\" data-end=\"4330\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  extern int i;  void f(); void g();  int main() {     f();     g();      printf(&quot;%d&quot;, i);      return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nextern int i;\n\nvoid f();\nvoid g();\n\nint main() {\n    f();\n    g();\n\n    printf(\"%d\", i);\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre><ol start=\"1\" style=\"list-style-type: upper-alpha;\"><li data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4401\">$\\texttt{0}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4401\">$\\texttt{1}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4401\">$\\texttt{2}$<br>&nbsp;</li><li data-start=\"4332\" data-end=\"4401\">Linker error</li></ol>",
