        {
          "post_id": "534937",
          "text": "<p>What is the output of the following code?</p><pre dir=\"ltr\" data-rawcode=\"#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;  int add(int n) {     static int total = 1;      total = total + n;      return total; }  int main() {     int i, ans = 0;      for (i = 1; i &lt;= 3; i++) {         ans = add(i);     }      printf(&quot;%d&quot;, ans);      return 0; }\" data-pbcklang=\"c_cpp\" data-pbcktabsize=\"\" data-linenums=\"true\" class=\"prettyprint linenums lang-c_cpp\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;\n\nint add(int n) {\n    static int total = 1;\n\n    total = total + n;\n\n    return total;\n}\n\nint main() {\n    int i, ans = 0;\n\n    for (i = 1; i &lt;= 3; i++) {\n        ans = add(i);\n    }\n\n    printf(\"%d\", ans);\n\n    return 0;\n}</pre>",
          "type": "Numerical",
